# Cache on page refresh

When adding or changing persisted client state (`localStorage` / `sessionStorage`):

1. Use the `lockin_police_` prefix (see `src/lib/storage.ts`).
2. On app load, call `prepareAppForNewVisit()` from `src/lib/cacheReset.ts` before any session reads (see `LockInPolice` mount effect).
3. Do not restore in-progress sessions from storage — opening the app should always show the Lock in screen. Full reload also clears all `lockin_police_*` keys.

Camera/media code must release `MediaStream` tracks on `pagehide` and component unmount to avoid a stuck camera after reload.
